esolved realm, Qwen direct claim, future-plugin row, identity confidence below exact, discovery proof from a different tuple, a smoke record with a tampered byte re-read, and an attempt to promote a gated cell through the smoke API. Crash/idempotency: if the evidence record is durable, install it under the landed no-replace + fsync discipline (sessrepo/sessckpt model) with crash hooks and a real-kill test; identical inputs replay byte-identical evidence. Narrowing mutants per refusal with a shipped harness and an applied harmless SURVIVED control; a conformance matrix mapping each 7.5/8.2/8.3/8.4/Appendix B clause to a test or a stated bound. This is the FINAL leaf (story_final CR): carry the Story-close items — update internal/traceability/ownership.v0.6.0.json bindings for sections 2.4/5.5/7.7/8 (the real declarations from kp4zpu, 3uzfyn and this leaf, honest coverage text, acceptance cases) and re-pin reviewedOwnershipCanonicalSHA256 (precedent Stories 3drr2m/3jqsx1/3m2mw8/2jylym); README sections for internal/sessprofile (if missing) and your package with test commands and no capability claim; LOGBOOK entry. Managed Story worktree contract: .temp/STORY-260830-315721/worktree on branch task-board/story/STORY-260830-315721 whose tip is the 3uzfyn checkpoint; leave the candidate UNCOMMITTED, never commit on the Story branch, never edit .task-board directly, never self-accept; if origin/main moves before your handoff (it will: a release-agnostic validation command is landing on trunk), run task-board worktree refresh-candidate TASK-260830-2zvo8m and restore any trunk-changed path the refresh left stale with a single-path git checkout HEAD -- <path> (task-board.config.json in particular must equal HEAD); before handoff verify git status shows only candidate paths (no __pycache__, no .pyc). Evidence contract as in the repository DoD. Read the Curator-managed go-testing-tools skill first; all CI local; run the full configured validation suite once before the handoff; hand off no later than 3.5 hours in (an 8-point leaf: if the full matrix cannot be finished, hand off a reviewable slice with the remaining rows enumerated precisely — but the Story-close items are mandatory). Attach TASK-260830-2zvo8m_results.md, TASK-260830-2zvo8m_conformance-matrix.md and TASK-260830-2zvo8m_producer-evidence.tar.gz (a real gzip archive), keep the checklist current, then task-board handoff TASK-260830-2zvo8m --role developer and exit promptly. Canonical CLI /Users/iv/.curator/global/bin/task-board. Model: muse-spark max. The independent reviewer will be muse-spark xhigh while codex is out of quota.","final_result":true}}}
