charged >= total:\\n1103-\\t\\treturn coverageFull\\n1104-\\tcase discharged*2 >= total:\\n1105-\\t\\treturn coveragePartial\\n1106-\\tdefault:\\n1107-\\t\\treturn coverageSliver\\n1108-\\t}\\n1109-}\\n1110-\\n1111-// sectionCoverage is the measured result for one section binding.\\n1112-type sectionCoverage struct {\\n1113-\\tKey        string\\n1114-\\tLevel      coverageLevel\\n1115-\\tDischarged int\\n1116-\\tTotal      int\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 2914,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 729,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
