m the unchanged original checkpoints and signs continuation; never\\nhand-commit the retained replay or edit workspace registry records.\\n\\nUsage:\\n  task-board worktree refresh-candidate <ELEMENT-ID> [flags]\\n\\nFlags:\\n  -h, --help                        help for refresh-candidate\\n      --replay-resolutions string   JSON file of checkpoint-bound conflict resolutions\\n\\nGlobal Flags:\\n      --board-dir string         Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default \\\".task-board\\\")\\n      --context-profile string   Agent context profile override: full or lite\\n      --insecure                 Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)\\n      --json                     Output in JSON format\\n      --no-update-check          Disable automatic update check\\n      --remote string            Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)\\n      --remote-board string      Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 4041,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1011,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
