{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000f231","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0ae2b-e184-7c10-8d9d-bac4c231b352"},"sequence":6003,"recorded_at":1780531400012001,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"be9157de-ded3-4e9d-94df-e7cb793fb0f2","payload_type":"run.terminal.completed","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"run_terminal","command_id":"be9157de-ded3-4e9d-94df-e7cb793fb0f2","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"be9157de-ded3-4e9d-94df-e7cb793fb0f2"},"terminal":"completed","text":"Ready for review — `TASK-260830-2zvo8m` handed off (`to-review`, checklist 14/14, 3 outcome artifacts attached).\n\n## What shipped\n\nNew package `internal/resumesmoke` (final leaf of the provider-identity-profile-and-resume story):\n\n- `Run` (`smoke.go`) — provider-specific probe → identify-session → discovery-bind → quiescence-precondition → resume-plan through `provhost.Host.Call`, recorded as one closed smoke record. U/? tuples refuse before any adapter call; C tuples gather read-only evidence and gate the resume plan with the Section 19.3 citation; only A cells pass. No promotion path, no capability surface.\n- `ResumeCell` (`matrix.go`) — Section 8.4 direction with Appendix B gates (Muse 0.1.0 pin reads unknown off-pin; Qwen unsupported; unknown never aliased to unsupported).\n- `VerifyRecord` (`record.go`) — closed shape, omit-self digest, verdict consistency; no secrets or raw native references.\n- `Store`/`Load` (`store.go`) — content-addressed, no-replace, fsynced installs with crash hooks.\n- Two zero-refusal-site provhost replay accessors (`ProbeBuild`, `SplitIdentifyResult`).\n\n## Evidence\n\n- AC coverage **16 of 16 rows** driven through production entries (table with call sites in `TASK-260830-2zvo8m_results.md`); row verdicts derive all 27 Section 8.4 rows from the pinned spec text, plus a real-process end-to-end run and a real-kill crash test.\n- Committed mutant harness: **10/10 narrowing mutants killed**, harmless control SURVIVED. Each runs in a private module copy — the first in-place version raced parallel tree-walking censuses under `go test ./...` and was replaced.\n- Story-close: ownership bindings 2.4 full 4/4, 5.5 sliver 1/3, 7.7 partial 3/4, 8 sliver 4/12 (12 new acceptance cases, pin re-pinned; `tracecheck` 113 cases, 29/463); README section + figures; LOGBOOK entry.\n- Validation all observed green: gofmt/vet/windows-vet/build, tracecheck, new `cataloggen -adopted -check` gate, cigate, full suite exit 0 (28 ok, pre- and post-refresh), full race exit 0, coverage (resumesmoke 77%).\n\nTrunk moved mid-run as predicted; `refresh-candidate` replayed both story checkpoints with signed continuation (two LOGBOOK order conflicts resolved trunk-first, content preserved), stale catalog/config paths restored to HEAD, and the candidate was left uncommitted for the handoff snapshot.","reason":null}}
